1.Create a new HTML file called foodie-profile.html with the full HTML5 boilerplate structure (<!DOCTYPE html>, <html>, <head>, <body>), and set the title to 
'My Foodie Profile'.
2.Inside foodie-profile.html, add headings and paragraphs to introduce yourself as a food lover, including your favorite cuisine and a short story about your 
best meal.
Ans.

<html>
<head>
    <title>My Foodie Profile</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 30px; line-height: 1.6; }
        h1, h2, h3 { color: #cb202d; }
        table { width: 100%; max-width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
        th, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; text-align: left; }
        th { background-color: #f4f4f4; }
        img { border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>My Foodie Profile</h1>
    
    <h2>Welcome to My Culinary Journey</h2>
    <p>Hello! I am an absolute food lover who finds pure joy in exploring diverse flavors, street foods, and fine dining experiences from around the world.</p>

    <h3>My Favorite Cuisine</h3>
    <p>My absolute favorite cuisine is Italian because of its wonderful balance of fresh herbs, rich cheeses, and comforting, handcrafted pasta dishes.</p>

    <h3>My Best Meal Story</h3>
    <p>During a trip to Italy a couple of years ago, I stumbled upon a tiny, family-run trattoria in Florence. I ordered a plate of handmade truffle pasta that completely blew my mind. The flavors were so rich and comforting that it remains the best meal I have ever had to this day!</p>
    <hr>


